  "description": "In-process ONNX Runtime GenAI text-generation backend for MCP Engram Memory synthesis. Optional companion to McpEngramMemory.Core: install it only if you want map-reduce memory synthesis to run fully in-process instead of against an Ollama daemon. Carries the ONNX Runtime GenAI native runtimes, which are large — see the package README.",
